text: ['All lands have indestructible.', 'As long as Kitesail Apprentice is equipped, it gets +1/+1 and has flying.', "As long as you control a Mountain, Summit Apes has menace. (It can't be blocked except by two or more creatures.)", 'As long as you control a Plains, Sejiri Merfolk has first strike and lifelink. (Damage dealt by a creature with lifelink also causes its controller to gain that much life.)', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, each player sacrifices a non-Vampire creature.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, if you control six or more lands, create a 5/5 red Dragon creature token with flying.', "At the beginning of your upkeep, you may look at the top card of your library. If it's a creature card, you may reveal it and put a quest counter on Quest for Ula's Temple.\\nAt the beginning of each end step, if there are three or more quest counters on Quest for Ula's Temple, you may put a Kraken, Leviathan, Octopus, or Serpent creature card from your hand onto the battlefield.", "Bojuka Bog enters the battlefield tapped.\\nWhen Bojuka Bog enters the battlefield, exile target player's graveyard.\\n{T}: Add {B}.", "Bojuka Brigand can't block.\\nWhenever Bojuka Brigand or another Ally enters the battlefield under your control, you may put a +1/+1 counter on Bojuka Brigand.", "Celestial Colonnade enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {W} or {U}.\\n{3}{W}{U}: Until end of turn, Celestial Colonnade becomes a 4/4 white and blue Elemental creature with flying and vigilance. It's still a land.", 'Chain Reaction deals X damage to each creature, where X is the number of creatures on the battlefield.', 'Colorless Eldrazi spells you cast cost {2} less to cast.\\n{7}, {T}: Search your library for a colorless creature card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.', 'Counter target instant spell.', 'Create a 1/1 green Snake creature token, a 2/2 green Wolf creature token, and a 3/3 green Elephant creature token.', 'Create two 1/1 white Soldier Ally creature tokens.', "Creeping Tar Pit enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {U} or {B}.\\n{1}{U}{B}: Creeping Tar Pit becomes a 3/2 blue and black Elemental creature until end of turn and can't be blocked this turn. It's still a land.", "Death's Shadow gets -X/-X, where X is your life total.", 'Defender\\nWhenever a creature you control with defender blocks, you may gain 2 life.', 'Destroy target artifact or enchantment. Its controller gains 4 life.', "Destroy target creature with mana value 3 or less. It can't be regenerated.", "Destroy target land, then Roiling Terrain deals damage to that land's controller equal to the number of land cards in that player's graveyard.", 'Draw two cards.\\nLandfall — If you had a land enter the battlefield under your control this turn, draw three cards instead.', 'Enchant creature or land\\nWhen enchanted permanent becomes tapped, destroy it.', "Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.\\nEnchanted creature can't be the target of spells or abilities your opponents control.", 'Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets +1/+0 for each Mountain you control and has first strike.', "Enchant creature\\nYou control enchanted creature.\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, sacrifice Vapor Snare unless you return a land you control to its owner's hand.", "Enchant land\\nEnchanted land is a 2/2 blue Elemental creature with flying. It's still a land.\\nWhen enchanted land dies, return that card to its owner's hand.", "Enchant land\\nEnchanted land is a 2/6 white Wall creature with defender. It's still a land.\\nWhen enchanted land dies, return that card to its owner's hand.", "Enchant land\\nEnchanted land is a 3/3 black Ooze creature. It's still a land.\\nWhen enchanted land dies, return that card to its owner's hand.", "Enchant land\\nEnchanted land is a 4/2 red Beast creature with trample. It's still a land.\\nWhen enchanted land dies, return that card to its owner's hand.", "Enchant land\\nEnchanted land is a 6/4 green Elemental creature. It's still a land.\\nWhen enchanted land dies, return that card to its owner's hand.", 'Equipped creature gets +1/+0 and has flying.\\nEquip {2} ({2}: Attach to target creature you control. Equip only as a sorcery.)', 'Equipped creature gets +2/+0.\\nWhenever equipped creature deals combat damage to a player, you may destroy target Equipment that player controls.\\nEquip {2}', 'Equipped creature has "{T}, Unattach Razor Boomerang: It deals 1 damage to any target. Return Razor Boomerang to its owner\'s hand."\\nEquip {2}', 'Equipped creature has deathtouch and lifelink.\\nEquip {2}', 'Exile target creature or enchantment.', 'First strike', 'Flying', 'Flying, protection from lands', "Flying, trample\\nYou can't win the game and your opponents can't lose the game.", "Flying\\nLandfall — Whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control, you may exile target nonland permanent other than Admonition Angel.\\nWhen Admonition Angel leaves the battlefield, return all cards exiled with it to the battlefield under their owners' control.", "Flying\\nWhen Pilgrim's Eye enters the battlefield, you may search your library for a basic land card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.", "Flying\\nWhenever Archon of Redemption or another creature with flying enters the battlefield under your control, you may gain life equal to that creature's power.", 'Flying\\nWhenever Butcher of Malakir or another creature you control dies, each opponent sacrifices a creature.', 'Flying\\n{1}{R}: Mordant Dragon gets +1/+0 until end of turn.\\nWhenever Mordant Dragon deals combat damage to a player, you may have it deal that much damage to target creature that player controls.', 'Halimar Depths enters the battlefield tapped.\\nWhen Halimar Depths enters the battlefield, look at the top three cards of your library, then put them back in any order.\\n{T}: Add {U}.', 'Haste\\nWhenever Akoum Battlesinger or another Ally enters the battlefield under your control, you may have Ally creatures you control get +1/+0 until end of turn.', 'Haste\\n{T}: Cunning Sparkmage deals 1 damage to any target.', "If a black creature with flying is attacking, you may pay {G} rather than pay this spell's mana cost.\\nDestroy target attacking creature with flying.", "If a white creature is attacking, you may pay {B}{B} rather than pay this spell's mana cost.\\nExile target attacking creature. Create a token that's a copy of that creature. Exile it at the beginning of the next end step.", "If an opponent cast a blue spell this turn, you may pay {R} rather than pay this spell's mana cost.\\nChange the target of target spell with a single target.", "If an opponent cast a red instant or sorcery spell this turn, you may pay {W} rather than pay this spell's mana cost.\\nPrevent the next 3 damage that a source of your choice would deal to you and/or permanents you control this turn. If damage is prevented this way, Refraction Trap deals that much damage to any target.", "If an opponent had a green creature enter the battlefield under their control this turn, you may pay {U} rather than pay this spell's mana cost.\\nTap up to two target creatures. Those creatures don't untap during their controller's next untap step.", "Islandwalk (This creature can't be blocked as long as defending player controls an Island.)\\nWhenever Thada Adel, Acquisitor deals combat damage to a player, search that player's library for an artifact card and exile it. Then that player shuffles. Until end of turn, you may play that card.", "Islandwalk, swampwalk (This creature can't be blocked as long as defending player controls an Island or a Swamp.)\\nWhenever Wrexial, the Risen Deep deals combat damage to a player, you may cast target instant or sorcery card from that player's graveyard without paying its mana cost. If that spell would be put into a graveyard, exile it instead.", 'Khalni Garden enters the battlefield tapped.\\nWhen Khalni Garden enters the battlefield, create a 0/1 green Plant creature token.\\n{T}: Add {G}.', 'Landfall — Whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control, Fledgling Griffin gains flying until end of turn.', 'Landfall — Whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control, Hedron Rover gets +2/+2 until end of turn.', 'Landfall — Whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control, Snapping Creeper gains vigilance until end of turn.', "Landfall — Whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control, you may have Cosi's Ravager deal 1 damage to target player or planeswalker.", 'Landfall — Whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control, you may have target creature get -1/-1 until end of turn.', 'Landfall — Whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control, you may pay {2}. If you do, draw a card.', 'Lavaclaw Reaches enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {B} or {R}.\\n{1}{B}{R}: Until end of turn, Lavaclaw Reaches becomes a 2/2 black and red Elemental creature with "{X}: This creature gets +X/+0 until end of turn." It\'s still a land.', 'Loam Lion gets +1/+2 as long as you control a Forest.', 'Multikicker {1} (You may pay an additional {1} any number of times as you cast this spell.)\\nChoose any target, then choose another target for each time this spell was kicked. Comet Storm deals X damage to each of them.', 'Multikicker {1} (You may pay an additional {1} any number of times as you cast this spell.)\\nChoose target creature, then choose another target creature for each time this spell was kicked. Put X +1/+1 counters on each of them.', "Multikicker {1}{B} (You may pay an additional {1}{B} any number of times as you cast this spell.)\\nSwampwalk (This creature can't be blocked as long as defending player controls a Swamp.)\\nQuag Vampires enters the battlefield with a +1/+1 counter on it for each time it was kicked.", 'Multikicker {1}{G} (You may pay an additional {1}{G} any number of times as you cast this spell.)\\nGnarlid Pack enters the battlefield with a +1/+1 counter on it for each time it was kicked.', 'Multikicker {1}{G} (You may pay an additional {1}{G} any number of times as you cast this spell.)\\nJoraga Warcaller enters the battlefield with a +1/+1 counter on it for each time it was kicked.\\nOther Elf creatures you control get +1/+1 for each +1/+1 counter on Joraga Warcaller.', 'Multikicker {1}{R} (You may pay an additional {1}{R} any number of times as you cast this spell.)\\nHaste\\nSkitter of Lizards enters the battlefield with a +1/+1 counter on it for each time it was kicked.', 'Multikicker {1}{U} (You may pay an additional {1}{U} any number of times as you cast this spell.)\\nCounter target spell unless its controller pays {2}. Draw a card for each time Spell Contortion was kicked.', "Multikicker {1}{U} (You may pay an additional {1}{U} any number of times as you cast this spell.)\\nIslandwalk (This creature can't be blocked as long as defending player controls an Island.)\\nEnclave Elite enters the battlefield with a +1/+1 counter on it for each time it was kicked.", "Multikicker {1}{W} (You may pay an additional {1}{W} any number of times as you cast this spell.)\\nCreatures you control get +1/+1.\\nWhen Marshal's Anthem enters the battlefield, return up to X target creature cards from your graveyard to the battlefield, where X is the number of times Marshal's Anthem was kicked.", 'Multikicker {1}{W} (You may pay an additional {1}{W} any number of times as you cast this spell.)\\nFlying\\nApex Hawks enters the battlefield with a +1/+1 counter on it for each time it was kicked.', 'Multikicker {2} (You may pay an additional {2} any number of times as you cast this spell.)\\nEverflowing Chalice enters the battlefield with a charge counter on it for each time it was kicked.\\n{T}: Add {C} for each charge counter on Everflowing Chalice.', 'Multikicker {B} (You may pay an additional {B} any number of times as you cast this spell.)\\nWhen Bloodhusk Ritualist enters the battlefield, target opponent discards a card for each time it was kicked.', 'Multikicker {G} (You may pay an additional {G} any number of times as you cast this spell.)\\nWhen Wolfbriar Elemental enters the battlefield, create a 2/2 green Wolf creature token for each time it was kicked.', 'Multikicker {R} (You may pay an additional {R} any number of times as you cast this spell.)\\nWhen Deathforge Shaman enters the battlefield, it deals damage to target player or planeswalker equal to twice the number of times it was kicked.', 'Multikicker {U} (You may pay an additional {U} any number of times as you cast this spell.)\\nFlying\\nWhen Voyager Drake enters the battlefield, up to X target creatures gain flying until end of turn, where X is the number of times Voyager Drake was kicked.', 'Multikicker {W} (You may pay an additional {W} any number of times as you cast this spell.)\\nFlying\\nWhen Lightkeeper of Emeria enters the battlefield, you gain 2 life for each time it was kicked.', 'Nonartifact spells cost {1} more to cast.', 'Protection from red\\nWhenever a player casts a red spell, you may gain 1 life.', 'Put a +1/+1 counter on target creature you control. Another target creature blocks it this turn if able.', 'Raging Ravine enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {R} or {G}.\\n{2}{R}{G}: Until end of turn, Raging Ravine becomes a 3/3 red and green Elemental creature with "Whenever this creature attacks, put a +1/+1 counter on it." It\'s still a land.', 'Reach (This creature can block creatures with flying.)', "Return target permanent you control and target permanent you don't control to their owners' hands.", 'Reveal cards from the top of your library until you reveal a nonland card, then put all cards revealed this way into your hand.', 'Ruthless Cullblade gets +2/+1 as long as an opponent has 10 or less life.', 'Search your library for any number of nonland cards, exile them, then shuffle.', "Searing Blaze deals 1 damage to target player or planeswalker and 1 damage to target creature that player or that planeswalker's controller controls.\\nLandfall — If you had a land enter the battlefield under your control this turn, Searing Blaze deals 3 damage to that player or planeswalker and 3 damage to that creature instead.", 'Sejiri Steppe enters the battlefield tapped.\\nWhen Sejiri Steppe enters the battlefield, target creature you control gains protection from the color of your choice until end of turn.\\n{T}: Add {W}.', "Shroud (This creature can't be the target of spells or abilities.)\\nLandfall — Whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control, you may switch Calcite Snapper's power and toughness until end of turn.", "Smoldering Spires enters the battlefield tapped.\\nWhen Smoldering Spires enters the battlefield, target creature can't block this turn.\\n{T}: Add {R}.", "Stirring Wildwood enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {G} or {W}.\\n{1}{G}{W}: Until end of turn, Stirring Wildwood becomes a 3/4 green and white Elemental creature with reach. It's still a land.", "Swampwalk (This creature can't be blocked as long as defending player controls a Swamp.)", 'Target creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn. Untap that creature.', 'Target creature gets +2/+0 until end of turn.', 'Target creature gets +2/+2 until end of turn.\\nLandfall — If you had a land enter the battlefield under your control this turn, that creature gets +4/+4 until end of turn instead.', 'Target creature gets -2/-2 until end of turn.\\nLandfall — If you had a land enter the battlefield under your control this turn, that creature gets -4/-4 until end of turn instead.', 'Target creature gets -3/-3 until end of turn. You may tap any number of untapped Vampire creatures you control. If you do, put a +1/+1 counter on each of those Vampires.', 'Target player gains 4 life.\\nLandfall — If you had a land enter the battlefield under your control this turn, that player gains 8 life instead.', 'Target player reveals a number of cards from their hand equal to the number of Swamps you control. You choose one of them. That player discards that card.', 'This spell costs {1} less to cast for each attacking creature.\\nCreate a 6/12 colorless Construct artifact creature token with trample. Exile it at the beginning of your next end step.', 'Trample\\nWhenever Graypelt Hunter or another Ally enters the battlefield under your control, you may put a +1/+1 counter on Graypelt Hunter.', 'When Avenger of Zendikar enters the battlefield, create a 0/1 green Plant creature token for each land you control.\\nLandfall — Whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control, you may put a +1/+1 counter on each Plant creature you control.', 'When Stoneforge Mystic enters the battlefield, you may search your library for an Equipment card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.\\n{1}{W}, {T}: You may put an Equipment card from your hand onto the battlefield.', "When Surrakar Banisher enters the battlefield, you may return target tapped creature to its owner's hand.", 'When Terastodon enters the battlefield, you may destroy up to three target noncreature permanents. For each permanent put into a graveyard this way, its controller creates a 3/3 green Elephant creature token.', "Whenever Grotag Thrasher attacks, target creature can't block this turn.", 'Whenever Hada Freeblade or another Ally enters the battlefield under your control, you may put a +1/+1 counter on Hada Freeblade.', 'Whenever Halimar Excavator or another Ally enters the battlefield under your control, target player mills X cards, where X is the number of Allies you control.', 'Whenever Kalastria Highborn or another Vampire you control dies, you may pay {B}. If you do, target player loses 2 life and you gain 2 life.', 'Whenever Novablast Wurm attacks, destroy all other creatures.', 'Whenever Pulse Tracker attacks, each opponent loses 1 life.', 'Whenever Shoreline Salvager deals combat damage to a player, if you control an Island, you may draw a card.', 'Whenever Slavering Nulls deals combat damage to a player, if you control a Swamp, you may have that player discard a card.', 'Whenever Talus Paladin or another Ally enters the battlefield under your control, you may have Allies you control gain lifelink until end of turn, and you may put a +1/+1 counter on Talus Paladin.', "Whenever Tuktuk Scrapper or another Ally enters the battlefield under your control, you may destroy target artifact. If that artifact is put into a graveyard this way, Tuktuk Scrapper deals damage to that artifact's controller equal to the number of Allies you control.", 'Whenever a Goblin enters the battlefield under your control, you may put a quest counter on Quest for the Goblin Lord.\\nAs long as Quest for the Goblin Lord has five or more quest counters on it, creatures you control get +2/+0.', "Whenever a creature an opponent controls attacks, if you're the defending player, create a 3/3 red Ogre creature token unless that creature's controller pays {3}.", "Whenever a creature you control becomes tapped, you may put a quest counter on Quest for Renewal.\\nAs long as there are four or more quest counters on Quest for Renewal, untap all creatures you control during each other player's untap step.", 'Whenever a permanent enters the battlefield tapped and under your control, untap it.', "Whenever an opponent discards a card, you may put a quest counter on Quest for the Nihil Stone.\\nAt the beginning of each opponent's upkeep, if that player has no cards in hand and Quest for the Nihil Stone has two or more quest counters on it, you may have that player lose 5 life.", 'Whenever you cast a kicked spell, you may have Rumbling Aftershocks deal damage to any target equal to the number of times that spell was kicked.', "You don't lose unspent green mana as steps and phases end.\\nOmnath, Locus of Mana gets +1/+1 for each unspent green mana you have.", 'You may have Jwari Shapeshifter enter the battlefield as a copy of any Ally creature on the battlefield.', 'You may play an additional land this turn.\\nDraw a card.', "You may put target creature card from your graveyard on top of your library. If you do, Dead Reckoning deals damage equal to that card's power to target creature.", 'You may tap or untap target artifact, creature, or land.\\nDraw a card.', "[+2]: Look at the top card of target player's library. You may put that card on the bottom of that player's library.\\n[0]: Draw three cards, then put two cards from your hand on top of your library in any order.\\n[−1]: Return target creature to its owner's hand.\\n[−12]: Exile all cards from target player's library, then that player shuffles their hand into their library.", '{T}: Add X mana of any one color, where X is the number of Allies you control.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{1}, {T}, Sacrifice Tectonic Edge: Destroy target nonbasic land. Activate only if an opponent controls four or more lands.', "{T}: Add {C}.\\n{4}: Dread Statuary becomes a 4/2 Golem artifact creature until end of turn. It's still a land.", '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{T}, Sacrifice Quicksand: Target attacking creature without flying gets -1/-2 until end of turn.', "{T}: Exile the top card of target player's library. If it's a land card, you gain 1 life.\\nLandfall — Whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control, you may untap Scrib Nibblers.", "{T}: Put target creature card from an opponent's graveyard onto the battlefield under your control if its mana value is less than or equal to the number of Allies you control.", "{T}: Target land you control becomes an X/X Elemental creature until end of turn, where X is the number of Allies you control. It's still a land.", '{T}: Target player gains control of target artifact, creature, or land you control.', '{T}: Untap target Forest.', '{T}: You may put a land card from your hand onto the battlefield.', '{U}, {T}: You may tap or untap another target creature.\\nLandfall — Whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control, you may untap Tideforce Elemental.', '{W}, {T}: Exile target land you control, then return it to the battlefield under your control.']
flavor: ['"A river of lava is just another river to cross."', '"After years of study, I\'ve learned an important lesson: the relics we watch may be watching us back."\\n—Anowon, the Ruin Sage', '"Assume everything wants to kill you. At the very least, assume everything wants what\'s in your pack."', '"Before I hire new recruits, I test how long they can hold their breath. You\'d be surprised how often it comes up."\\n—Zahr Gada, Halimar expedition leader', '"Cast out by my tribe, I am a pariah trapped in this mammal\'s carcass. Only my true kin hear my cries."', '"Cosi has many followers. Even the volcano finds a way to do his bidding."\\n—Zakken, Enclave cleric', '"Give me a sturdy rope over the advice of any so-called expert. I can thread the dark wilds better than anyone."', '"I care nothing for treasure. The land beckons me, and I cannot rest until my feet have touched every inch of it."', '"I don\'t do tactics. I don\'t do guard duty. I do damage. Take it or leave it."', '"I like it here. You always get a little more for your mana."\\n—Chandra Nalaar', '"I of all people know that memory is not a safe place to hide valuables."\\n—Jace Beleren', '"I see the weaknesses you hide even from yourself."', '"I toiled in Kazuul\'s mines when I was eight. I think I\'m tough enough for a little hiking."', '"If this world could make a wish, it would be to survive the parasites who loot its treasures and threaten its life force."\\n—Saidah, Joraga hunter', '"If you climb Skyfang Peak, avoid the pass. Generations of apes made that trail, and they don\'t tolerate trespassers."\\n—Sachir, Akoum Expeditionary House', '"It\'s gone mad! Loose the chains and save what you can!"', '"Murasan hurdas were too aggressive to tolerate a harness, so we put them on guard duty. Now the bandits can\'t get within spitting distance of us."\\n—Bruse Tarl, Goma Fada nomad', '"My battle cry reaches ears far keener than yours."\\n—Saidah, Joraga hunter', '"No need for a hurda? How about these maps to recently discovered tombs? Or these vials of invisible potion? Very fancy . . ."', '"Now that it has woken up and wandered off, we should go see what it was guarding."\\n—Gotzen, Bulwark explorer', '"On this plane, the use of magic can provoke a ferocious reprisal from nature. Whoever the Eldrazi were, their relics left Zendikar forever enraged."\\n—Jace Beleren', '"So many have died in search of that map. And now it appears in the hands of the arrogant child Chandra Nalaar."', '"Somehow it warps the Æther. It brings a strange weight, a blockade in the flow of spellcraft."\\n—Noyan Dar, Tazeem lullmage', '"Swords may sunder. Shields may fail. My will is stronger than steel, and my flesh and bone far more deadly."', '"The Roil is destructive, but not random. It\'s Zendikar\'s way of revealing secrets."\\n—Ilori, merfolk falconer', '"The best expedition would be an entire team of me."', '"The flow is diverted. Your path is clear. What are you waiting for—the cave to bid you welcome?"\\n—Maizah Shere, Tazeem lullmage', '"The longer the journey, the more one learns."\\n—Isanke, Halimar seastalker', '"The shadow travels toward the apex. I predict we will soon see the true measure of darkness."', '"The sun was born within its coils, but it fled to the sky. The wurm hungers for its child, and the world will bear its loss."\\n—Screed of the Mul Daya', '"The trembling lands ruptured, leaving an open door for things from below to emerge."\\n—Screed of the Mul Daya', '"The wind smells of misfortune. Check your knots."\\n—Anitan, Ondu cleric', '"They search for treasures that wash up from the depths. Tracking one could lead you to riches. Or in circles."\\n—Javad Nasrin, Ondu relic hunter', '"This world will not be tamed."', '"We move because the earth does."\\n—Bruse Tarl, Goma Fada nomad', '"We stand between the jaws of chaos and the mantle of order."', '"We train for the improbable, like lightning striking the same place twice, or striking everywhere at once."\\n—Nundari, Sea Gate militia captain', '"We\'re making progress, but its desire to explore still far exceeds its ability."\\n—Amadi, Halimar griffin-master', '"Why fill pockets with gold when you can fill hearts with conviction?"', '"You always have a choice. That doesn\'t mean you always have a good choice."\\n—Alubri, Guul Draz gatekeeper', '"You know how to tell a sapling explorer from an old hardhead? See which one mistakes a swarm of jagwasps for the setting sun."\\n—Chadir the Navigator', 'A shrine to unchecked desire.', "An explorer's reward is a view of tomorrow's possibilities.", 'An eye closes. A race awakens.', 'As the bridge snapped, Berko was sure he heard the swamp laughing at him.', 'Astride the bucking creature, Gribble hurtled down the mountainside while his Grotag brethren cheered. It was at that moment that legend of the Skrill Tamer was born.', 'Beneath the gaze of angels, only the righteous may stand without fear.', 'By hammer forged, and by hammer undone.', 'Carving lines through the sky, kite sailors map trails for the pilgrims below to follow.', 'Crafted by lullmages and bound to the land, it alters itself to match the tumultuous terrain.', "Creatures of the air wisely avoid the darkest regions of Guul Draz—which is why grappler spiders inhabit the few places touched by the sun's rays.", 'During their endless travels, the mages of the Goma Fada caravan have learned ways to harness both life and death.', "Each of Malakir's great families boasts a contingent of nulls appropriate to its rank in society.", 'Ebb and flow, high tide and low, quick as sand and just as slow.', 'Expeditionary houses are notorious for their rivalries. But when adventurers meet in the wilderness, the instinct for mutual survival outweighs petty grudges.', 'Few can catch it without losing a finger.', 'Having lost their minds, they now want yours.', 'He calls on the forests for counsel and summons the earth to his cause.', 'He makes his home on the tallest mountain in Sejiri, where the vista is as endless as his patience.', "He'll cleave wood and bone alike to carve a path for his allies.", 'Heavy enough to withstand the Roil, leatherback skeletons are havens for travelers in storms and landshifts.', 'His slaves crave death more than they desire freedom. He denies them both.', 'His verdict is always guilty. His sentence is always death.', "In Zendikar, today's grassland could be tomorrow's jungle, and hunting grounds change as quickly as the weather.", 'In his last seconds, Remhas regretted using his most powerful spell.', 'It gathers against the coming storm.', 'Its vast network of roots and vines keeps it aware of distant dangers.', 'Kitesailing is a way of life—and without practice, the end of it.', 'Many venture out to hunt for treasures. Others lie in wait to hunt the hunters.', 'Not all deaths are etched with mythic meaning and iconic glory.', 'Novice explorers can mistake the acid-carved stone lairs for ancient ruins. They rarely survive to learn better.', 'Pulse trackers terrorize adventurers, driving them through the jungle toward certain death at the gates of Malakir.', 'She wields a blade as bloodthirsty and elegant as herself.', "Surrakar grab things they *don't* want.", 'The Forsaken Ones haunt the ruins that flicker in and out of the spirit realm. Such sites are hard to find and even harder to loot.', 'The Jwari winds undo reality as easily as they scatter a pile of leaves.', 'The Mul Daya elves reject their Tajuru kin, calling them arrogant tree-binders who think the roots serve the canopy.', 'The Tajuru elves devised ways to let the forest defend itself.', 'The goblin fancied himself a rider. The lizard was happy with its new flail.', 'The instinct for survival makes enemies of all.', 'The kor send their thopter kites to see if the land is in a welcoming mood.', 'The last reliable landmark in Tazeem just walked away.', 'The shadow of the candle looms tall even as its light grows dim.', 'Until Emeria is freed, he raises his sword in her name.', 'Using thermal updrafts and gravity currents, drakes eat and sleep in the air. Some never touch the ground from birth until death.', "Warning to those who scale the cliffs without paying tribute: It's a long way down.", 'Zendikar is a brutal taskmaster, but sometimes it offers unexpected solace.']
artist: ['Adi Granov', 'Alex Horley-Orlandelli', 'Andrew Robinson', 'Anthony Francisco', 'Austin Hsu', 'Chippy', 'Chris Rahn', 'Christopher Moeller', 'Cyril Van Der Haegen', 'D. Alexander Gregory', 'Daarken', 'Dan Murayama Scott', 'Daniel Ljunggren', 'Daren Bader', 'Dave Kendall', 'David Palumbo', 'Donato Giancola', 'Eric Deschamps', 'Franz Vohwinkel', 'Greg Staples', 'Howard Lyon', 'Igor Kieryluk', 'Izzy', 'Jaime Jones', 'James Paick', 'James Ryman', 'Jason A. Engle', 'Jason Chan', 'Jason Felix', 'Jesper Ejsing', 'Johann Bodin', 'John Avon', 'Jung Park', 'Karl Kopinski', 'Kekai Kotaki', 'Kev Walker', 'Kieran Yanner', 'Lars Grant-West', 'Matt Cavotta', 'Matt Stewart', 'Michael Komarck', 'Mike Bierek', 'Paul Bonner', 'Raymond Swanland', 'Rob Alexander', 'Ryan Pancoast', 'Scott Chou', 'Steve Argyle', 'Steve Prescott', 'Steven Belledin', 'Svetlin Velinov', 'Todd Lockwood', 'Tomasz Jedruszek', 'Trevor Claxton', 'Vance Kovacs', 'Vincent Proce', 'Volkan Baǵa', 'Véronique Meignaud', 'Warren Mahy', 'Wayne Reynolds', 'Zoltan Boros & Gabor Szikszai', 'rk post']
